sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Tenant admin (Studio)
  participant GV as governance
  participant T as Temporal
  participant IN as ingestion
  participant RT as retrieval
  participant CV as conversation
  participant OT as other services
  participant AU as audit

  A->>GV: request tenant deletion
  GV->>AU: record request
  GV->>T: start DeleteTenant workflow
  par fan-out
    T->>IN: tenant.delete (files, versions, objects)
    T->>RT: tenant.delete (chunks, vectors, caches)
    T->>CV: tenant.delete (conversations, checkpoints)
    T->>OT: tenant.delete (usage detail, traces, tools)
  end
  IN-->>T: confirmed
  RT-->>T: confirmed
  CV-->>T: confirmed
  OT-->>T: confirmed
  T->>T: verify no residue (isolation probes)
  T-->>GV: completed (backups expire per policy)
  GV->>AU: record completion
  GV-->>A: deletion status + certificate
